        <summary>
          <para>TTY (teletypewriter) mode is in hearing carryover mode (HCO). The microphone is muted but the speaker is on. The user will communicate with the remote party by sending text messages and hearing an audible reply.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/telephony/TelephonyManager#TTY_MODE_HCO" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.telephony.TelephonyManager.TTY_MODE_HCO</code>.</a></format></para>
